<title>SINGAPORE: UOB sees higher 1996 group profit growth.</title>
<headline>UOB sees higher 1996 group profit growth.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Overseas Bank chairman Wee Cho Yaw said on Thursday the group's 1996 net profit growth would be higher than in 1995.</p>
</text>
